<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT- Fluke started as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT- Fluke started as outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney initiated coverage of Fluke Corp with an outperform rating, a source at the firm said.</p>
<p>-- Details were not available.</p>
<p>-- Fluke's stock was 1-5/8 higher at 43-1/4 on the New York Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
